        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/f05b48/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-14T13:09:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"jsz2\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n jsz2:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I have a new goal. &nbsp;Play a game with Ra vs Dawn, bring her down to 2 hp, flip her, and then kill her with Wrathful Gaze while Dawn is Merged with the Sun.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Dawn, merged with the Sun. Ra is the Sun God, aka can be said to be the Sun.</p>\n<p>Dawn x Ra? A NEW SHIP HAS SAILED.</p>",
